{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122304","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122304/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122304/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122304/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122304","id":5121225660,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc79j_9V","number":122304,"title":"Skeleton3D: Fix invalid bone name error formatting","user":{"login":"veyhh","id":314995089,"node_id":"U_kgDOEsZxkQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/314995089?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh","html_url":"https://github.com/veyhh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","color":"E94A26","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-11T14:26:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T15:04:21Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T14:26:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122304","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122304.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122304.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"﻿## Summary\n\n`Skeleton3D::add_bone()` rejected invalid bone names with:\n\n```cpp\nvformat(\"Bone name cannot be empty or contain ':' or '/'.\", p_name)\n```\n\n`p_name` was passed to `vformat()` without a `%s` placeholder, so formatting failed and the intended validation message was lost.\n\nThis change adds the missing `%s` so the invalid bone name is included in the error message.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No runtime tests were run locally because a compiled Godot binary is not available in this environment.\n- The change only affects error-message formatting; bone validation behavior is unchanged.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Call `Skeleton3D.add_bone(\"\")` and confirm the error mentions the bone name constraint (no `vformat` formatting error).\n- [ ] Call `Skeleton3D.add_bone(\"foo:bar\")` and `add_bone(\"foo/bar\")` and confirm both return `-1` with a clear error that includes the invalid name.\n- [ ] Call `Skeleton3D.add_bone(\"valid\")` and confirm it still succeeds.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122304/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}